  "prefLabel": "Agr 1403.14 Predetermined Tares Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1403.14 Predetermined Tares Prohibited. Public weighmasters shall not determine or establish a standard or average tare weight for a vehicle, container, or pallet for any purpose, or use a predetermined tare weight in any weighing.\n\nNew. #9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17 (formerly Agr 1403.14) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1400.html"
}
